Integration
-----------
AIGCPannel bundles DashBox as an engine: launch, status, and links only.
platform/ does not import dashbox Python. Default local URLs:

  Web UI : http://127.0.0.1:8080
  API    : http://127.0.0.1:8780

Start the engine with ./start-engine.sh (prints docker compose commands;
pass --up to run them). Crate/binary and OS config dir remain
comfy-downloader so existing models.json paths keep working.
